+/**
+ * org.apache.commons.codec.digest against independent models: libc crypt(3) (through Python's
+ * crypt module, when available), ports of the reference MurmurHash2/3 and xxHash32 functions,
+ * java.util.zip's CRC32/CRC32C, the CRC catalogue's CRC-16 parameters, JCA digests and MACs, and
+ * Git's object format for GitIdentifiers.
